# headwear/helm/crested: the Crested helm (P2c slice, SLICE-HELM-SHIELD): an open steel helm lit as a sphere (the lit left
# plane, the turn, the shadowed right; one glint at the crown's top-left), a lit brow band whose rim sits on the brow row
# (F-25 man, F-24 woman), short cheek guards on the face's outline columns and a neck guard at the back. The eyes, the
# nose pixel and the mouth always show. The crest is headwear/helm/crested_crest (the plume slot, the crest dial, the bob
# lag). Hair mask: '-' over the hair above the rim; below the rim the hair shows (the knight's braid, a ponytail).
# Shared by both bodies (D10: the head box carries the woman's row). Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h.
# Regions (P2c ladder slice, LADDER-HEAD; contracts 3b) mark the rim band R, its socket G and the brow band P; pixels unchanged.
# (LADDER-HEAD i3, w3/gen_mhelm.py) Mythic: the dome in burnished gold (metal 2) under the flame spire, the crown band
# in the blackened steel framing the face (i2's grey dome, gilt band and gilt cheeks ran into one orange mass)
use person
body adult
role helm form9
role helm band5
layer headwear
anchor head
keys hatpose
tags overlay
legend X glow 3
legend Z linen 4
legend k linen 3
legend l linen 2
legend D linen 1
legend U plume 4
legend T plume 3
legend S plume 2
legend R plume 1
legend Q plume 0

