# (LADDER-HEAD i2, w2/gen_top.py) the top of the ladder, faces open (i1's closed great helm read as a bucket):
# Mythic (helm.t6, man): the crowned helm in the blackened mythic steel, the gilt band, the brow gem burning (X); its
# flame crest and flame wings are crested_crest's. T6 (helm.t6, man): the crowned winged helm: the starmetal dome, a gilt
# crown band of three points, the brow gem breathing in the glow slot (X); the white wings are crested_crest's.
# T5 (helm.t5): the visored crested helm: a raised visor across the brow with gilt edges and breaths, a beak past the
# face in profile, long gilt cheek guards; the great swept plume is crested_crest's.
# (LADDER-HEAD alloys i2, w2/g2.py) Mythic (helm.t6,mythic): the dome in the blackened mythic steel
# (a dark core, the lit left plane, a hard glint) split by a gilt rib, the gilt brow band and its burning gem (X); the
# flame crown is crested_crest's, a small circlet on the dome top. Back view: two neck lames, a gilt rim
# (LADDER-HEAD alloys i2) T5 back: a gilt ridge down the dome, two neck lames, the guard flared at a gilt rim
# (LADDER-HEAD alloys i2, w2/g2.py) Mythic (helm.t6,mythic): the dome in the blackened mythic steel
# (a dark core, the lit left plane, a hard glint) split by a gilt rib, the gilt brow band and its burning gem (X); the
# flame crown is crested_crest's, a small circlet on the dome top. Back view: two neck lames, a gilt rim
# (LADDER-HEAD alloys i2, w2/g2.py) Mythic (helm.t6,mythic): the dome in the blackened mythic steel
# (a dark core, the lit left plane, a hard glint) split by a gilt rib, the gilt brow band and its burning gem (X); the
# flame crown is crested_crest's, a small circlet on the dome top. Back view: two neck lames, a gilt rim
# (LADDER-HEAD alloys i2, w2/g2.py) Mythic (helm.t6,mythic): the dome in the blackened mythic steel
# (a dark core, the lit left plane, a hard glint) split by a gilt rib, the gilt brow band and its burning gem (X); the
